  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>M</mi></math> and <math><mi>N</mi></math> are two non singular matrices of order <math><mn>3</mn></math> with real entries such that <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi></math>. If&nbsp;<math><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi>λ</mi></math> is equal to (where, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;represents the adjoint matrix of matrix&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>&nbsp;represents an identity matrix)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> &hellip;. <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> &hellip;. <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,</p><p><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
